<div class="row pdp-overview m-b-40">
	<div class="col">

        
        
                    
            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-pdp-component-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>The G60’s IEC 61850 Process Bus module is designed to interface with the Multilin HardFiber System, allowing bi-directional IEC 61850 fiber optic communications. The HardFiber System is designed to integrate seamlessly with existing Universal Relay applications, including protection functions, FlexLogic, metering and communications.&nbsp;</p><p><a class="d-inline-flex align-items-center pdp-acc-readmore" href="/electrification/automation/protection-control-metering/multilin-hardfiber-system-legacy">Learn More<img src="/electrification/themes/custom/ge_grid/src/images/greenarrow-icon.svg" width="17" height="16" loading="lazy"></a></p><p>The G60 can also connect to GE Vernova MU320 or third-party merging units using standard IEC 61869 or IEC 61850-9-2LE communication protocols.</p></div>
      		
        
